WEBVTT

00:09:27.271 --> 00:09:30.232
and she knows she's right,
she apologizes for it?

00:09:30.983 --> 00:09:34.194
She says, "I'm sorry, but I don't think
those numbers add up."

00:09:34.236 --> 00:09:37.531
You know, you don't have
to apologize for being right.

00:09:37.531 --> 00:09:44.496
(Cheers and applause)

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:49.376
Since I'm new to this gender,
I asked my good friend Jen, I said,

00:09:49.418 --> 00:09:51.295
"What are women looking for in men?"

00:09:51.879 --> 00:09:56.592
She said, "Women are looking for men
who will honor our uniqueness,

00:09:56.634 --> 00:09:58.927
who will realize our gifting
is not lesser,

00:09:58.969 --> 00:10:00.763
it's not weaker, it's just different.